 3) elements of the natural landscape such as hydrography, vegetation, etc.; 4) administrative boundaries; 5) toponyms.", "num_resources": 1, "num_tags": 31, "organization": {"id": "9eeff220-80c1-4da9-a7ef-fd2af6e2fb78", "name": "geodati-gov-it-rndt", "title": "GeoDati - RNDT", "type": "organization", "description": "", "image_url": "", "created": "2024-03-08T18:47:26.076098", "is_organization": true, "approval_status": "approved", "state": "active"}, "owner_org": "9eeff220-80c1-4da9-a7ef-fd2af6e2fb78", "private": false, "state": "active", "title": "1884 Milano: Carta Tecnica Comunale - Quadro unione scala 1:25000 - 1884 Milano: Municipal Base Map  - scale 1:25000", "type": "dataset", "url": "", "version": null, "extras": [{"key": "contact_email", "value": "geoportale@comune.milano.it"}, {"key": "contact_name", "value": "Comune di Milano"}, {"key": "contact_uri", "value": "https://geodati.gov.it/resource/pointOfContact/C_F205:SIT_CENTRALE_M188430001:20150514-1"}, {"key": "guid", "value": "https://geodati.gov.it/resource/id/C_F205:SIT_CENTRALE_M188430001:20150514"}, {"key": "landingpage", "value": "https://gisportal.comune.milano.it/image/rest/services/Cartografie_Raster/Milano_1884_CTC_GB/ImageServer"}, {"key": "publisher_uri", "value": "https://geodati.gov.it/resource/administration/C_F205:SIT_CENTRALE_M188430001:20150514/publisher"}, {"key": "source_catalog_description", "value": "Il servizio di ricerca del RNDT fornisce l'accesso ai metadati su dati e servizi territoriali delle Pubbliche Amministrazioni italiane. Esso \u00e8 conforme alle specifiche CSW (ISO Application Profile) di OGC e alle linee guida INSPIRE sui servizi di ricerca"}, {"key": "source_catalog_homepage", "value": "https://geodati.gov.it/"}, {"key": "source_catalog_language", "value": "http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ITA"}, {"key": "source_catalog_modified", "value": "2026-09-18"}, {"key": "source_catalog_publisher", "value": "{\"uri\": \"https://indicepa.gov.it/ricerca/